> On Fri, Dec 21, 2001 at 03:56:57PM +0100, Erik Verbruggen wrote:
>
> > > When the machine power ups, no SRM console is presented, and only a
> > > 'blue screen' is shown. Is there any way I can get the SRM console or
> >
> > Probably the NT loader (forgot the name).
>
> I believe that the machine used to run Digital Unix. Blue screen
> which is shown is totaly blank (no text on it).
