Don't crosspost.

Your console is probably going to the serial port.  There are a couple of
reasons this could happen.  First, you may just not have your keyboard
plugged in.  Second, even if you did have the keyboard plugged in, the
console may be set to serial.  Try setting up a serial console.  (You can
then reconfigure it for graphics console by doing 'set console graphics')

