Hello all,

Our company had Personal Workstation 433a running with winnt.
It has not been used for a year.

I don't know nothing about alpha, so the little SRM help was just
great! I have installed from the snapshot version. I used a floppy to
boot the installation. Since the Unix SRM didn't support the graphic
card, I use a vt100 connected to serial1.
The only problem I have is that the ethernet device, de0, doesn't
work well: At boot it can't detect the cable and after few minutes
it's comming alive.

A little tip: It took me very long time to find out how to boot in
multiuser mode. The "-a" boot flag was hidden in the SRM help. I
think it should be moved from the SRM help to the installation
procedure.

Thank's for the Aplha porters, It's great!!!



=====
Best Regards,
Dan
